--------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. THIRD-PARTY COURSE MATERIAL  —  NOT LICENSED HERE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

These pages summarise, paraphrase and in places quote teaching material from
the B.S. in Management & Technology programme at the Indian Institute of
Technology Jodhpur, delivered through Masai School's learning platform.

That underlying material — including lecture content, worked examples, case
studies, figures, direct quotations from faculty, and a small number of
multiple-choice questions reproduced from a course slide deck — remains the
intellectual property of IIT Jodhpur and the respective faculty members.
It is NOT covered by sections 1 or 2 above, and no licence to it is granted
by this repository.

It is included here for the private study of students enrolled on the
programme, who already have authorised access to the same material through
the official learning platform.

If you are a rights holder and would like something removed or amended,
please contact the author at the link at the top of this file.


